+# FreeBindCraft 0.11.9+fbc2 candidate
+
+Frozen parent: 678c58eaaafc33c5b31bcc6b6d0176dd078f6063.
+Includes the reviewed BF16 attention capability and v5 slice-before-convert rule.
+Slice conversion defaults on; METALJAX_SLICE_BEFORE_CONVERT=0 disables it diagnostically.
+Attention remains off unless METALJAX_EVO_ATTN=1.
+JAX/jaxlib 0.11.2 and the fbc1 frozen MLX SDK/runtime are retained.
+Scheduling and governor defaults are unchanged. Licensing/notices remain in place.
+This revision and tag remain local until separate release approval.
